   ╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮   
   │ Move                                Conversations                      │   
   │ j/k       down / up                 r/R       reply / reply all        │   
   │ J/K       page down / up            f         forward                  │   
   │ ^d/^u     half page down / up       A/D       open / save attachments  │   
   │ gg/G      top / bottom              a         archive                  │   
   │ h/l       pane left / right         dd        move to Trash            │   
   │ enter/esc open / back               I         move to Inbox            │   
   │ n/p       next / prev (reader)      N         mark read / unread       │   
   │                                     *         star / unstar            │   
   │ Everywhere                          x         select for bulk actions  │   
   │ c         write a new mail          u         undo the last change     │   
   │ /         search all mail           o         expand / collapse all    │   
   │ s         sync now                  O         open in Gmail (web)      │   
   │ [/]       previous / next account                                      │   
   │ b         show / hide mailboxes     Go to                              │   
   │ ?         this help                 gi/gs     Inbox / Starred          │   
   │ q         quit                      gt/gd     Sent / Drafts            │   
   │                                     ga/g#     All Mail / Trash         │   
   │                                     g!        Spam                     │   
   │                                                                        │   
   │ Press any key to close.                                                │   
   ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯   
                                                                                